{"id": "rf-001", "lang": "en", "text": "I have pain on my right side, 8 out of 10, and my urine is pink since yesterday. I've also lost 6 kg this month.", "context": {"history": {"rcc": true}}, "label": {"urgency": "high"}, "tags": ["golden_path"], "notes": "Demo case 1, explicit."}
