{"id": "rf-003", "lang": "en", "text": "Nothing serious really, just a bit of pain in my side, about 8, and some blood in the urine. Felt dizzy earlier.", "context": {"history": {"rcc": true}}, "label": {"urgency": "high"}, "tags": ["minimizer"], "notes": "Patient plays it down."}
